.TH bhtune-opc-search 1  "bhtune-opc-search "
.SH NAME
bhtune\-opc\-search \- Search the OPC DA namespace without downloading the whole tree
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbhtune\-opc\-search\fR [\fB\-\-bridge\-host\fR] [\fB\-\-server\fR] [\fB\-\-match\-mode\fR] [\fB\-\-max\-results\fR] [\fB\-\-session\-id\fR] [\fB\-\-scope\-node\-key\fR] [\fB\-\-include\-branches\fR] [\fB\-\-refresh\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIQUERY\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Search the OPC DA namespace without downloading the whole tree
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-bridge\-host\fR \fI<BRIDGE_HOST>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-server\fR \fI<SERVER>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-match\-mode\fR \fI<MATCH_MODE>\fR [default: contains]
How the query should match
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
exact
.IP \(bu 2
prefix
.IP \(bu 2
contains
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-results\fR \fI<MAX_RESULTS>\fR [default: 200]
Maximum number of matches
.TP
\fB\-\-session\-id\fR \fI<SESSION_ID>\fR
Existing bridge browse session to search within
.TP
\fB\-\-scope\-node\-key\fR \fI<SCOPE_NODE_KEY>\fR
Opaque node key limiting the search scope
.TP
\fB\-\-include\-branches\fR
Include branch nodes as search results
.TP
\fB\-\-refresh\fR
Ask the gateway to refresh its namespace view
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIQUERY\fR>
Text to find in node labels/item IDs
